    "Welcome - Title": "Welcome",
    "Welcome - 1": "1. Music and speaker can be toggled with Y or pressing the Joystick. Settings can be changed via MENU then Settings.",
    "Welcome - 2": "2. Edit your config and profiles online: MENU \u2192 Edit Config Online. The app uploads your data and shows a short code. Enter it at sw.zeugs.me to edit in your browser.",
    "Welcome - 3": "3. Story texts and speaker audio are saved only if you mark a story as favourite before leaving the app. (Can be copied from the SD-Card)",
    "Welcome - 4": "4. The dot on the top right, when the speaker is reading, is an indicator. If it is green, it is currently reading the text to you. Blinking orange means preparing, yellow means paused, red means finished.",
    "Welcome - 5": "5. Disable Story Images in Settings (MENU\u2192START\u2192Story Images) for faster/shorter waits between texts.",
    "Welcome - 6": "6. Preview speaker voices at openai.fm. If no voice is set in config, the speaker changes each time.",
    "Welcome - 7": "7. Disclaimer: No warranty. Use at your own risk.",
